WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.216
An array has 2 rows of 3 counters. How many counters are in the array? Let us think

00:00:06.216 --> 00:00:11.229
carefully. Use repeated addition: add 3 exactly 2 times. The answer is 6. Great work!

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:17.784
Follow the rule add 4: 9, 13, 17, blank . What is missing? Let us think carefully.

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:21.505
Add 4 one more time. The answer is 21. Great work!

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:28.255
Follow the rule subtract 4: 66, 62, 58, blank . What is missing? Let us think

00:00:28.255 --> 00:00:32.671
carefully. Subtract 4 one more time. The answer is 54. Great work!

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:39.898
An array has 5 rows of 6 counters. How many counters are in the array? Let us think

00:00:39.898 --> 00:00:44.849
carefully. Use repeated addition: add 6 exactly 5 times. The answer is 30. Great

00:00:44.849 --> 00:00:45.203
work!
